{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15210430","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521043001:1":{"text":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","source_cn":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76C99605159DE83C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","female":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","variant_male_record_index":"181984","variant_female_record_index":"181985","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1521043001":{"text":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","source_cn":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76C99605159DE83C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","female":"보칼리스로 돌아가려고? 나는 조금 더 있고 싶은데.","variant_male_record_index":"181984","variant_female_record_index":"181985","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521043002:0":{"text":"응! 남에게 인정받은 건 이번이 처음이거든. 아, 아버지랑 페르세우스 빼고.","source_cn":"嗯！这是我第一次得到别人的认可——呃，除了我父亲和珀尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7911E80F7FA5A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521043003:0":{"text":"게다가 한 명도 아니고 엄청 많은 병사들이었잖아! 다들 내 지휘가 훌륭했다고 해줬어!","source_cn":"而且不是一个人，是很多很多士兵！他们都觉得我刚才的指挥很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF5C9E13054115B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521043004:0":{"text":"...아반드, 하나 물어보고 싶은 게 있어요.","source_cn":"……阿邦德，我有一个问题想要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B113667A35D50D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521043005:0":{"text":"아반드 님이라고 불러야지! 나랑 오래 같이 다녔으니 이번 한 번만 봐줄게.","source_cn":"你应该叫我阿邦德殿下。不过看在你们陪我这么久的份上，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4058CC44B40A2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521043006:0":{"text":"그래서 뭐가 궁금한 거야?","source_cn":"你问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA56743EA28B4A56F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521043007:0":{"text":"...만약 당신에게 결정권이 있었다면, 아쿠보르와 전쟁을 했을까요?","source_cn":"……如果你能决定，你会向雅库伯尔发起战争吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x274A16A2C703AB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521043008:0":{"text":"음... 어려운 질문이야...","source_cn":"唔……你问的问题好难回答……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D452DB49A9A683B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521043009:0":{"text":"난... 잘 모르겠어.","source_cn":"我想……我不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0EDF0EB51BA41EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521043010:0":{"text":"왜죠? 당신은 영주잖아요.","source_cn":"为什么？你是领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCD72BB164BE54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521043011:0":{"text":"하지만 전쟁은 보칼리스인들이 원한 거였어.","source_cn":"但是发动战争是呼临人的呼声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB41A9F72B452FB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521043012:1":{"text":"아버지가 살아계실 때도 보칼리스는 루나애니와 충돌한 적이 있었고...","source_cn":"父亲还在的时候，呼临城就和兽人起过冲突……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B16257D39068EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521043013:0":{"text":"보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 갈등은 오래된 거야. 의원들 뿐만 아니라 백성들... 심지어 페르세우스도 루나애니를 좋아하지 않아.","source_cn":"呼临城和雅库伯尔的矛盾很久了。不止是议事官，还有那些普...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2905F0B896533395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521043014:0":{"text":"아무리 영주라도, 뭐든 맘대로 다 할 수 있는 건 아니니까.","source_cn":"不是领主想要怎么做，就能怎么做的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27BB4F089C2F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521043015:0":{"text":"백성들이 당신의 말을 듣는다면요?","source_cn":"如果民众都听你的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4F188ED19DFF847","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521043016:0":{"text":"그럴 리 없어. 모두 각자의 생각이 있어서, 내 명령을 절대적으로 따르지 않아.","source_cn":"怎么可能？他们是人，有自己的想法，不可能完全听从我的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF210160C3D48EF1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521043017:0":{"text":"아버지가 그러셨어. 영주는 도시를 다스리는 사람이지만, 사실 다른 사람과 다를 게 없다고.","source_cn":"我父亲说过，领主是统治城邦的人，但其实和其他人没区别。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44116F7C247B7AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521043018:0":{"text":"모두가 우리의 다스림을 받는 건, 그저 그게 더 안정적으로 살 수 있는 방법이기 때문이야.","source_cn":"大家服从我们的统治，是因为这样做，可以安稳地生活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D218FFB7E6423A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521043019:1":{"text":"만약 안정적으로 살 수 없다면 인간은 통치자에게, 영주에게... 심지어 스스로에게도 반항할 거야.","source_cn":"如果不能安稳生活，人就会反抗。反抗统治，反抗领主……甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5A0972D0821953D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521043020:0":{"text":"그럼... 왜 군대를 보내지 않았어요? 반항하면 벌을 받아야 하잖아요.","source_cn":"那……为什么不派出军队？反抗的人，应该受到惩罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433185093E86C1A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521043021:0":{"text":"너... 생각하는 게 너무 무서워...","source_cn":"你……你有些想法真的很可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80B4147D4DB370C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521043022:0":{"text":"반항하는 사람들... 직접 본 적 없지? 얼마나 끔찍한지 넌 모를 거야.","source_cn":"你见过反抗的场景吗？那很惨烈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B96042B0256BD6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521043023:1":{"text":"기근이 막 시작됐을 때, 사람들은 빵 하나 때문에 싸웠어. 점잖았던 사람들도 머리에 천을 둘러쓰고 물건을 훔치며 약탈했지.","source_cn":"饥荒刚开始的时候，有很多人为了一袋面包大打出手。还有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B19583665863DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521043024:0":{"text":"병사들이 아무리 막아도 소용 없었어. 오히려 다치기만 했지... 자기가 든 창에 갑옷이 뚫릴 정도였어...","source_cn":"士兵怎么管也管不过来，甚至还会被那些人打伤……被自己的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F5088297E9861B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521043025:1":{"text":"난 그런 모습을 보고 싶지 않아... 하지만 실제로 그런 일이 있었어.","source_cn":"我不想看到那样的场景……但它真的发生了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E668E1CB92AB34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1521043025":{"text":"난 그런 모습을 보고 싶지 않아... 하지만 실제로 그런 일이 있었어.","source_cn":"我不想看到那样的场景……但它真的发生了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E668E1CB92AB34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521043026:0":{"text":"변장을 하고 몰래 나갔었거든.","source_cn":"是我换了衣服，偷偷溜出去看到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x912FDACEF0BFB3C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521043028:1":{"text":"아버지가... 나에게 마지막으로 알려주신 거였어. 오늘처럼 평민의 옷을 입고 보칼리스를 둘러보라고...","source_cn":"父亲他……他教给我的最后一件事，就是要像今天这样，换上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD473A236F5716320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521043029:0":{"text":"그래야 보칼리스의 진짜 모습을 볼 수 있다고 하셨어.","source_cn":"父亲说，只有这样才能看到呼临城真正的样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB03969B01ECDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:31:1521043029":{"text":"그래야 보칼리스의 진짜 모습을 볼 수 있다고 하셨어.","source_cn":"父亲说，只有这样才能看到呼临城真正的样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB03969B01ECDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521043030:0":{"text":"응. 아버지랑 비보 선생님이 많은 걸 가르쳐 주셨어.","source_cn":"嗯，父亲和比博老师教了我很多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65B11C0B3365EF3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521043031:0":{"text":"그렇다면... 아쿠보르에 직접 가보시는 건 어떨까요?","source_cn":"既然这样……你为什么不到雅库伯尔看一看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4ECFFEF1BBF8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521043032:0":{"text":"...응?","source_cn":"……诶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD8631A6295A1E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521043033:0":{"text":"나... 나보고 루나애니의 땅에 가라고? 가서 뭐 하게?","source_cn":"我……我去兽人的地盘？做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44D6E93228772EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521043034:0":{"text":"아쿠보르 사람들이 어떤지 직접 보는 거예요.","source_cn":"去看看雅库伯尔人到底是什么样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA40FD766EFC4429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1521043035:0":{"text":"가서 그들이 정말 여러분이 생각하는 짐승인지 당신의 두 눈으로 직접 확인해 보는 거죠.","source_cn":"去亲眼看看，雅库伯尔人是不是和你们想的一样，是野兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E17EB148F0D5A8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1521043036:0":{"text":"...그, 그런 생각은 해본 적 없어.","source_cn":"……我、我没想过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427AF00EB6B2877A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521043037:0":{"text":"나는 루나애니의 수장도 아니고, 우리는 너무 다른걸? 게다가 그냥 옷만 갈아입는다고 해서 그 안에 들어갈 수 있을 리가 없잖아!","source_cn":"我不是他们的首领。而且……我们太不一样了。我没办法普普...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBEC028AE1F733FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521043038:0":{"text":"만약 들어갈 수 있다면요?","source_cn":"如果可以呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AA3D103763C2982","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1521043039:0":{"text":"그럴 수 있다면...","source_cn":"如果可以……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC10C0263A1CB69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"